    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "双舒伯特多项式: 定义与例子",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            11,
            23,
            419,
            90
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "定义 (双舒伯特多项式)",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            17,
            200,
            289,
            258
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "设 $x = ( x _ { 1 } , \\ldots , x _ { n } ) , y = ( y _ { 1 } , \\ldots , y _ { n } )$ , 基多项式: ",
        "bbox": [
            17,
            274,
            501,
            329
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\mathfrak {S} _ {w _ {0}} (x, y) := \\prod_ {i + j \\leq n} (x _ {i} + y _ {j})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            362,
            368,
            631,
            478
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "对任意置换 $w \\in S _ { n }$ , 双舒伯特多项式定义为:",
        "bbox": [
            17,
            521,
            485,
            576
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\mathfrak {S} _ {w} (x, y) = \\partial_ {w ^ {- 1} w _ {0}} ^ {(x)} \\mathfrak {S} _ {w _ {0}} (x, y)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            353,
            607,
            640,
            682
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(∂(x) $( \\partial _ { w ^ { - 1 } w _ { 0 } } ^ { ( x ) }$ -1w 是作用在 $x$ 变量上的差分算子).",
        "bbox": [
            19,
            721,
            441,
            800
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "我们在下一页给出具体的几个双舒伯特多项式的例子.",
        "bbox": [
            17,
            831,
            582,
            886
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "",
