    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "双舒伯特多项式的乘积",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            11,
            23,
            339,
            90
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "我们尤其关注两个双舒伯特多项式乘积的展开. 事实上, 我们有如下的结果:",
        "bbox": [
            17,
            250,
            810,
            309
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "定理",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            19,
            341,
            79,
            392
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "对 $u , v \\in S _ { n }$ , 双舒伯特多项式的乘积可展开为:",
        "bbox": [
            17,
            411,
            505,
            466
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\mathfrak {S} _ {u} (x; y) \\mathfrak {S} _ {v} (x; z) = \\sum_ {w \\in S _ {\\infty}} c _ {u v} ^ {w} (y; z) \\mathfrak {S} _ {w} (x; y)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            284,
            505,
            710,
            615
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "这个展开式的存在性和唯一性是 Lascoux 和 Schützenberger 在双定义舒伯特多项式时(1980) 就已经给出了.",
        "bbox": [
            15,
            654,
            922,
            756
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "Positivity in quantum triple Schubert calculus ",
        "bbox": [
            362,
            964,
            635,
            992
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "2026 年 1 月 3 日",
        "bbox": [
            754,
            964,
            865,
            996
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "6 / 16 ",
        "bbox": [
            951,
            964,
            988,
            992
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "具体的例子",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            13,
            23,
            178,
            90
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "我们给出两个简单的例子, 并观察它们展开式的各项系数.",
        "bbox": [
            17,
            145,
            622,
            203
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例",
        "bbox": [
            19,
            231,
            50,
            286
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\mathfrak {S} _ {\\mathrm {i d}} (x, y) \\mathfrak {S} _ {s _ {1}} (x, z) = \\left(y _ {1} - z _ {1}\\right) \\mathfrak {S} _ {\\mathrm {i d}} (x, y) + \\mathfrak {S} _ {s _ {1}} (x, y)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            242,
            317,
            754,
            376
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例",
        "bbox": [
            19,
            435,
            50,
            494
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\mathfrak {S} _ {s _ {1}} (x, y) \\mathfrak {S} _ {s _ {2}} (x, z) = \\mathfrak {S} _ {s _ {1} s _ {2}} (x, y) + \\mathfrak {S} _ {s _ {2} s _ {1}} (x, y) + (y _ {1} - z _ {1} + y _ {2} - z _ {2}) \\mathfrak {S} _ {s _ {1}} (x, y)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            114,
            529,
            880,
            588
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "我们发现, 上述两个例子中, 右侧展开式的系数都是属于 $\\mathbb { N } [ y _ { i } - z _ { j } ]$ . 事实上, 我们有如下的定理.",
        "bbox": [
            15,
            619,
            960,
            729
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "定理 (Yibo Gao, Rui Xiong)",
        "bbox": [
            17,
            756,
            331,
            819
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "对于 $u , v , w \\in S _ { \\infty }$ , 有 $c _ { u , v } ^ { w } ( \\mathbf { y } , \\mathbf { z } ) \\in \\mathbb { N } [ y _ { i } - z _ { j } ] _ { i , j \\geq 1 } .$ ",
        "bbox": [
            15,
            835,
            509,
            894
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "",
        "bbox": [
            713,
            925,
            993,
            956
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
