    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "量子双舒伯特多项式: 生成函数",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            13,
            23,
            454,
            86
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "设 x = (x1, . . . , xn), y = (y1, . . . , yn) 为两组变量. 对 $k \\geq 1$ , 我们首先定义 量子初等对称多项式的生成函数:",
        "bbox": [
            15,
            164,
            960,
            270
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\Delta_ {k} (t \\mid x _ {1}, \\dots , x _ {k}) := \\sum_ {j = 0} ^ {k} t ^ {k - j} e _ {j} (x _ {1}, \\dots , x _ {k} \\mid q _ {1}, \\dots , q _ {k - 1})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            211,
            309,
            781,
            454
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "其中 $e _ { j } ( x \\mid q )$ 是量子初等对称多项式, 且该生成函数等价于三对角矩阵的行列式:",
        "bbox": [
            15,
            494,
            860,
            549
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\Delta_ {k} (t \\mid x) = \\det  \\left( \\begin{array}{c c c c} x _ {1} + t & q _ {1} & \\ldots & 0 \\\\ - 1 & x _ {2} + t & \\ddots & \\vdots \\\\ \\vdots & \\ddots & \\ddots & q _ {k - 1} \\\\ 0 & \\ldots & - 1 & x _ {k} + t \\end{array} \\right)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            245,
            588,
            743,
            858
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "",
        "bbox": [
